" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Samuel Doe</span><span class="tp">1951–1990</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/ahmad-shah-massoud"><span class="ph ph-person" aria-hidden="true"></span><span><span class="nm">Ahmad Shah Massoud</span><span class="tp">1953–2001</span></span></a></li></ul></section>
